{
  "schema": "lean-proof-simplification-evidence-v1",
  "source_commit": "e8e12903c2807b7e7ce2a71e1b5be899f40c014e",
  "source_parent": "a149b6faade6f1d61c77b3ccfb14205d8d3cbc6c",
  "scope": "Share current carry Facts to MF conversion across seven modules",
  "validation": "Corrected paired seven-target, seven-check and four-direct-client lanes pass. Seven checks and two production client object pairs match; focused probes for the two differing clients retain 76 identical declaration/type/axiom reports. Combined 18-object probes remove six private names, add one public Facts.toMF, preserve 90 common declaration/type/axiom reports and match global default simp and instance censuses. Thirteen of fifteen external direct source/object pairs match prior successful producer receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "The helper is a new public declaration visible to existing CurrentCarryConstruction importers; six prior private names are removed. Qualified-name reference search is limited to tracked Lean files under Computability/DiophantineConsistency/Lean; an earlier repository-wide search was interrupted.",
    "Two direct cached pairs, WangTiles942PowerDimensions and NativeRankVariation, lack matching producer receipts in the stated search; sampled source/object hashes do not authenticate their relationship. The large umbrella importer and wider project/Foundation/Mathlib transitive closure were not rebuilt.",
    "The two differing client objects have matching focused name/type/axiom reports; the combined global simp and instance census is unchanged. This does not establish proof-body equality or equality of all persistent environment extensions.",
    "The preliminary final lane used an old MF carry provider and was interrupted on DummySafety; it is preserved as historical and is not part of the corrected paired validation. The corrected lanes use current-source MF provider objects; their transitive dependencies remain cached.",
    "Shared-load timing samples are not general benchmarks. Author records predate the commit; independent review/audit verify commit and parent. Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted and their temporary /dev/shm paths remain necessary for external byte verification."
  ],
  "archive": "inputs-and-logs.zip",
